            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Preserve the order of the semantic parts; keep the opening time, concession or topic phrase first. Express the concession between a growing earlier trend and a later factory closure.",
